  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Construction of a health center in Kpangalam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">At the request of KPANGALAM - CHATEAU&apos;s dwellers, the NGO CAV proposes to set up a health center in this corner estimated at more than 6000 persons. The goal of this project is to bring health care closer in this corner. That is part of the second Result  of the NGO&apos;s strategic plan, relating to the reduction of the rate of morbidity and maternal and infant mortality by the end of 2025.</narrative>
  </description>
